{
 "name": "sidecar-raw-stdio-model",
 "about": "stdio 部署上一次完整的 execute，场景扮演宿主应答 sidecar 发来的 model module_call（hostModelInvokerPort.ts:194-213，requestId model-<随机>、payload.preparationId prepared-<随机>-<序号>；diff.mjs 规则 21）：(1) 宿主回成功的事件流（ok: true, payload.events），比 sidecar 推出的 agent.* 事件、completed 终止帧（payload.result / messages / seedState / modelState）与之后的 status；(2) 宿主回失败（ok: false + code + error.message），callModule 记下 moduleFailure（agentLoopSidecarServer.ts:472-484），终止帧是 failed，带 code、error 与 payload.moduleFailure；(3) 宿主回的 payload 没有 events 数组（INVALID_MODEL_RESPONSE）。每一步等到上一条终止帧再发下一条 execute。写完关闭 stdin，进程正常退出。",
 "server": false,
 "steps": [
  {
   "sidecar": "stdio",
   "readMs": 4000,
   "send": [
    {
     "json": {
      "kind": "request",
      "messageId": "x1",
      "method": "execute",
      "runId": "run-1",
      "operationId": "op-1",
      "requestId": "rq-1",
      "payload": {}
     }
    },
    {
     "until": {
      "text": "\"method\":\"module_call\""
     },
     "timeout": 8000,
     "save": {
      "m1Msg": "\"messageId\":\"([^\"]+)\"",
      "m1Req": "\"requestId\":\"([^\"]+)\""
     }
    },
    {
     "json": {
      "kind": "response",
      "messageId": "host-m1",
      "inReplyTo": "{saved.m1Msg}",
      "requestId": "{saved.m1Req}",
      "ok": true,
      "payload": {
       "events": [
        {
         "type": "request_started",
         "provider": "default",
         "model": "default"
        },
        {
         "type": "message_start",
         "role": "assistant"
        },
        {
         "type": "text_delta",
         "text": "hi from host"
        },
        {
         "type": "message_end",
         "finishReason": "stop"
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "until": {
      "text": "\"requestId\":\"rq-1\",\"final\":true"
     },
     "timeout": 10000
    },
    {
     "json": {
      "kind": "request",
      "messageId": "s1",
      "method": "status",
      "requestId": "rq-1"
     }
    },
    {
     "json": {
      "kind": "request",
      "messageId": "x2",
      "method": "execute",
      "runId": "run-2",
      "operationId": "op-2",
      "requestId": "rq-2",
      "payload": {}
     }
    },
    {
     "until": {
      "text": "\"method\":\"module_call\""
     },
     "timeout": 8000,
     "save": {
      "m2Msg": "\"messageId\":\"([^\"]+)\"",
      "m2Req": "\"requestId\":\"([^\"]+)\""
     }
    },
    {
     "json": {
      "kind": "response",
      "messageId": "host-m2",
      "inReplyTo": "{saved.m2Msg}",
      "requestId": "{saved.m2Req}",
      "ok": false,
      "code": "PROVIDER_DOWN",
      "error": {
       "message": "provider down"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "until": {
      "text": "\"requestId\":\"rq-2\",\"final\":true"
     },
     "timeout": 10000
    },
    {
     "json": {
      "kind": "request",
      "messageId": "s2",
      "method": "status",
      "requestId": "rq-2"
     }
    },
    {
     "json": {
      "kind": "request",
      "messageId": "x3",
      "method": "execute",
      "runId": "run-3",
      "operationId": "op-3",
      "requestId": "rq-3",
      "payload": {}
     }
    },
    {
     "until": {
      "text": "\"method\":\"module_call\""
     },
     "timeout": 8000,
     "save": {
      "m3Msg": "\"messageId\":\"([^\"]+)\"",
      "m3Req": "\"requestId\":\"([^\"]+)\""
     }
    },
    {
     "json": {
      "kind": "response",
      "messageId": "host-m3",
      "inReplyTo": "{saved.m3Msg}",
      "requestId": "{saved.m3Req}",
      "ok": true,
      "payload": {
       "nothing": true
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "until": {
      "text": "\"requestId\":\"rq-3\",\"final\":true"
     },
     "timeout": 10000
    },
    {
     "json": {
      "kind": "request",
      "messageId": "s3",
      "method": "status",
      "requestId": "rq-3"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "",
     "end": true
    }
   ]
  }
 ],
 "accepted": [
  {
   "id": "module-call-abortsignal-field",
   "why": "基线 bug（与它自己的协议 schema 矛盾）：sidecar 发给宿主的 module_call 帧里带 \"abortSignal\":{}（hostModelInvokerPort.ts:101 把 AbortSignal 对象放进了调用载荷，序列化成空对象），基线自己的 schema 校验下这些帧不合法（上游验收集：基线 1204 帧里 326 帧因此不合法）。Rust 不发这个字段，全部帧合法。只放过这个字段本身",
   "paths": [
    "^\\$\\.steps\\[\\d+\\]\\.(sidecar|raw)\\.lines\\[\\d+\\]\\.abortSignal$"
   ]
  }
 ]
}
